      "content": "BOVINGDON              \tCHIPPERFIELD ROAD TL 00 SW  \t\t\t\t\t(South side)                                        6/12                                    \tNo. 58 -                                      \t\t(The White Cottage) -                                   \t\tII House.  C17, altered in C18, C19 W extension and single storey rear service wing.  Timber frame with brick at ground floor and roughcast above.  Old red tile roof.  2-storeys, 2-cells, end-chimneys central entrance plan house with E end outshut.  3 windows to each floor.  Door now moved to W from original position.  Large gable chimneys with oversailing caps. E chimney larger and projects. 2- and 3-light casement windows. String course at floor level above brick lower part. Box frame timbering with curved braces to undulating tie-beams. Clasped-purlin roof with collar and queen-strut trusses. Infill may be wattle and daub. Ground floor in C18 red and black tiles. Wainscotting. Chamfered axial floor beams with stepped hollow stops. Open fireplace and old staircase preserved under present stair. (Roberts(1975)No.13). Listing NGR: TL0207603250"
    }
  ],
